    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__PROMETHEUS_UID__"
      },
      "description": "Error budget burn at four windows against a 1% budget. The target underneath it is UNPROVEN \u2014 set against 14 admission events. Burn rate 1 means the observed error ratio equals the allowed ratio, so the budget would be spent exactly over the full compliance window, not over the query window. ALWAYS READ IT BESIDE THE VALID-EVENT COUNT: a burn of 100 from one failure in one event is arithmetically correct and operationally meaningless. Ships as a panel, never a rule, because paging on an unproven target is how alerting gets muted.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "id": 24,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(sum(rate(agentsfleet_admissions_total{outcome=~\"deferred|refused\"}[1h])) / sum(rate(agentsfleet_admissions_total{outcome!=\"over_budget\"}[1h]))) / 0.01",
          "legendFormat": "1h burn",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "(sum(rate(agentsfleet_admissions_total{outcome=~\"deferred|refused\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(agentsfleet_admissions_total{outcome!=\"over_budget\"}[5m]))) / 0.01",
          "legendFormat": "5m burn",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "(sum(rate(agentsfleet_admissions_total{outcome=~\"deferred|refused\"}[6h])) / sum(rate(agentsfleet_admissions_total{outcome!=\"over_budget\"}[6h]))) / 0.01",
          "legendFormat": "6h burn",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "expr": "(sum(rate(agentsfleet_admissions_total{outcome=~\"deferred|refused\"}[30m])) / sum(rate(agentsfleet_admissions_total{outcome!=\"over_budget\"}[30m]))) / 0.01",
          "legendFormat": "30m burn",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ],
      "title": "How fast we are burning the admission budget (target unproven)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__PROMETHEUS_UID__"
      },
      "description": "The same four windows against the 5% runner-success budget, counting PLATFORM faults only so it burns on the same events the objective measures, equally UNPROVEN \u2014 set against 10 executions. Same warning: read it beside execution volume, since a burn rate computed over a handful of events says nothing. Both climbing together is an infrastructure problem, runner alone is a workload problem.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9
